# A skilled fighter, with violence_update on. In the temple (3001), with Hassan: Smokegod (60) sets every skill of
# Heroic (51, a warrior) to 100, so each round has a second and a third attack, enhanced damage, and parries, dodges
# and shield blocks against the mobs. Heroic kills a kitten (3090, fast: an extra attack each round) and then fights a
# septon (9006), each fight running until someone is DEAD. At 51, Heroic is a hero: no experience is gained.
@updates area,violence
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
set skill heroic all 100
@as hero
@mob 3090 3001
kill kitten
@pulse until 400 is DEAD!!
@state
@mob 9006 3001
kill septon
@pulse until 600 is DEAD!!
@state
